1
00:00:00,359 --> 00:00:02,489
(Penny:)No. No woman would.

2
00:00:03,237 --> 00:00:06,077
See, now, that's the great thing.
We're out as friends.

3
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:08,240
(Leonard:)This is not a date. Sex is off the table.

4
00:00:08,409 --> 00:00:10,739
(Leonard:)So let's go learn
why hydroelectric power...

5
00:00:10,911 --> 00:00:14,331
(Leonard:)...might not be the environmental
bargain you think it is.

6
00:00:16,041 --> 00:00:18,581
(Leonard:)Sorry, spoiler alert.

7
00:00:19,878 --> 00:00:23,128
- Ugh. All right. Fine.
- Thanks.

8
00:00:23,298 --> 00:00:25,178
Uh, tickets are 11 bucks.

9
00:00:29,513 --> 00:00:31,093
(Penny:)Not a date.

10
00:00:35,018 --> 00:00:36,898
(Raj:)Come on, Sheldon. Star Wars.

11
00:00:37,062 --> 00:00:38,852
I'm pushing play. I mean it.

12
00:00:39,022 --> 00:00:42,522
Yeah, if we don't start soon,
George Lucas is gonna change it again.

13
00:00:45,612 --> 00:00:48,652
(Sheldon:)This would go a lot faster
if you put your diploma to work...

14
00:00:48,824 --> 00:00:51,744
...and help me set up this high-frequency
tone generator.

15
00:00:52,327 --> 00:00:55,037
I have a master's degree from MIT.

16
00:00:55,205 --> 00:01:00,025
(Sheldon:)Yeah, but you've got a can-do attitude,
and that's what's important.

